Over a {{ v('policy.clv_horizon_months') }} month horizon at {{ v('policy.clv_discount_rate_annual') }} a
year, lifetime value per customer has a mean of {{ v('clv.clv.mean') }}, a median of
{{ v('clv.clv.median') }} and a ninetieth percentile of {{ v('clv.clv.p90') }}. The allowance is that
value times the {{ v('policy.contribution_margin') }} contribution margin times a payback share of
{{ v('policy.clv_payback_share') }}: {{ v('clv.allowance.overall') }} per acquired customer overall, from
